DESCRIPTION:Join us on the Third Monday of the month to learn about electro
 nics. We are working with the Radio Shack Electronic Learning Lab and worki
 ng our way through the accompanying workbook by Forrest Mims. Each month we
  progress through the workbook to learn new aspects of electronics. <br><br
 >This month we will explore the function of Voltage Regulators and Op-Amps 
 supplied with the Electronic Learning Lab.&nbsp\;<br>New attendees to the I
 ntroduction to electronic circuits series will need to pay a $5 workshop fe
 e. Non-members of the KzooMakers makerspace will be charged a $5 facility f
 ee.<br><br>For questions\, contact: <a href="mailto:ronald.schubot@kzoomake
 rs.org" target="_blank">ronald.schubot@kzoomakers.org</a><br><br>The worksh
 op is free to Makerspace members and $5 for non-members. <br><br>There may 
 be  optional items available for purchase to facilitate additional home stu
 dy.  <br><br><br>RSVP: <a href="https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/qb
 kfgpyxdbzb/" target="_blank" id="ow347" __is_owner="true">https://www.meetu
 p.com/KzooMakers/events/259570305/?isFirstPublish=true</a><br><br>For a com
 plete listing of events\, please visit <a href="http://kzoomakers.org/event
 s-calendar/" target="_blank">http://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T101536Z
LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI\, Kalamazoo\, M
 I 49048\, USA\, Meeting Area
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Introduction to Electronic Circuits: Voltage Regulators and op-amps
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
