CREATED:20190527T192108Z
DESCRIPTION:Come make your own infinity cube\, and do it better than me. Th
 is is a fabrication challenge!\n\nCost to attend: $25/35 (Kzoo Maker paying
  members/non-members)\n\nIn this workshop\, attendees will:\n\n-purchase a 
 kit of pre-cut parts\n-tweak their parts on the belt sander for optimal fit
 -up\n-use a sculpy clay mold to tack their cube together\n-get extremely fr
 ustrated when their parts don't fit up\n-be allowed extra pre-cut pieces if
  need be\, since the fit-up on this project is a challenge.\n-use a wire wh
 eel and hand dremel to grind their tacks and make their infinity cube shine
 \n-Take home what they make!\n\nDuring this workshop we will be exposed to 
 heat\, sparks\, and sharp metal edges. Gloves\, jackets\, and welding helme
 ts will be provided. Attendees MUST wear natural fiber pants and closed toe
  shoes\, NO MESH TENNIS SHOES ALLOWED.\n\nIt is recommended that you wear o
 r bring a long sleeved shirt.\n\nLimit of 5 attendees.\n\nContact: allison.
 poliak@kzoomakers.org\n\nRSVP: https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/261
 811935/\n\nFor a complete listing of all events\, please visit https://kzoo
 makers.org/events-calendar/
LAST-MODIFIED:20190608T204949Z
LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Infinity Cube Project Workshop - canceled
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
