CREATED:20200826T161355Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><span><span>Interested in lasers? Come check out ours. Meet 
 with artist Kevin Hayden as he takes you through the basic workflow of an 8
 0W laser cutter and we make an edge-lit acrylic sign! There will be a short
  lecture and a demonstration.</span></span></p><p><span><span>Each attendee
  will receive an LED sign with your choice of art\, complete with a wall pl
 ug and remote.</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><b>Tickets
  will be $45 (Two tickets for $80\, so bring a friend!)</b>&nbsp\; </span><
 /span></span></span></span></p><p><b><span><span>Kzoo Makers Members: $35 (
 Two tickets for $65)</span></span></b></p><p><span><span><b>Limit of 10 att
 endees</b> due to social distancing guidelines. Please wear a mask during t
 his event\, for everyone's safety.</span></span></p><br><span><b>BUY TICKET
 S HERE:</b> https://www.eventbrite.com/e/118111704287</span><span><br></spa
 n>
