CREATED:20190413T010013Z
DESCRIPTION:During this workshop\, we will cover how to tack weld 5 metal p
 ieces into a box.\n\nA few of the steps included in this workshop:\nputting
  on proper PPE\nwatching demo on how to sucessfuly tack weld\npositioning t
 he metal\nmaking your tacks\n\nThis is a hands on workshop. You will be exp
 osed to heat\, sparks\, and hot metal.\n\nCost: \n\n$20 members/$30 non-mem
 bers\n (5 pieces of metal included)\n\nSafety training will be provided.\nS
 afety equipment will be provided.\n\n**This workshop is part of a continuin
 g workshop meant to expose members to welding at a low price point and in a
  safe and instructional manner.\nIt is meant as part of a series and not as
  a stand alone event. New members are welcome to sign up for the repeat of 
 the Exposure class if they\nhave not taken it already.\n\nPersonal Protecti
 on Equipment required:\n\n1) Closed Toed Shoes. Preferably leather boots. S
 teel toe not required but recommend.\n2) Natural Fiber clothes (linen\, cot
 ton\, khakis\, jeans\, leather) (Not provided)\n3) Flame retardant welders 
 jacket (class set provided\, members are encouraged to place an order with 
 me or to purchase their own)\n4) Welder's Helmet (Class set provided\, memb
 ers are encouraged to place an order with me or provide their own)\n5) Leat
 her MIG welding gloves (Class set provided\, members are encouraged to plac
 e an order with me or provide their own)\n\nTools we will be working with:\
 nWelder (provided)\nWelders pliers (eight ways) (Provided)\nLocking pliers 
 (Provided)\nWire brush (provided)\nChisel (provided)\nAngle Grinder (Provid
 ed\, safety training provided)\n\nQuestions: allison.poliak@kzoomakers.org\
 n\nLimit of 4 attendees.\nRSVP: https://www.meetup.com/Portage-Womens-Socia
 l-Meetup/events/259459006/\n\nFor a complete listing of events\, please vis
 it http://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/\nAnd on meetup: https://www.meetu
 p.com/Portage-Womens-Social-Meetup/
LAST-MODIFIED:20190413T010013Z
LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tack Welding Workshop Repeat Event
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
