DESCRIPTION:REGISTER THROUGH EVENTBRITE by clicking this link (coming soon)
 <br><br><strong>Are you craving connection\, expression\, or maybe a safe p
 lace to share your latest creative project? Please consider joining this ev
 ent.</strong><br><br><br><h3>Agenda:</h3><ul><li>Introductions during the f
 irst 5 minutes</li><li>8-10 presenters\, 5-10 minutes each</li><li>Announce
 ments\, 5 minutes at the end</li><li><strong>****UPDATED 2/1/2021**** Stay 
 an additional hangout time after the presentations - 30 minutes or until 9p
 m\, whichever is earlier</strong></li></ul><p>Next date- First Thursday of 
 the month</p><p></p><p></p><br><p>CALLING ALL CREATORS!!! If you are a craf
 ter\, hobbyist\, artist\, business owner\, knitter\, do it yourself-er\, ma
 ker\, foodie\, and other categories not named\, we want to know what you ar
 e working on! We know you are making things. Here is a chance to take a tur
 n to share or just sit and learn.</p><p>Moderated by Stacy Belinsky (Serend
 ipity Spot/Kzoo Makers) and co-hosted with Christopher Kaminsky (Lakeshore 
 Fab Lab).</p><p>****UPDATED 2/1/2021**** Stay an additional hangout time af
 ter the presentations and chat with the group for 30 minutes or until 9pm\,
  whichever is earlier.</p>
