DESCRIPTION:This is a repeat of the welding training offered to the woman's
  welding group in the past. \n\nIt will be open to two woman's welding memb
 ers\, and two Makerspace members. It will be held every Saturday from 4/13/
 2019 to 05/04/2019\, when we will schedule a new round of workshops. \n\nTh
 is workshop is required to train people in using the welder and being safe 
 in the welding zone. Any member or non member who wants to do other project
 s\, whether supervised or not\, in the welding zone needs to take this trai
 ning or schedule an alternate training time with the welding zone leader. \
 n\nCost: $10 members/$15 non-members\n\nQuestions: allison.poliak@kzoomaker
 s.org\n\nRSVP: https://www.meetup.com/Portage-Womens-Social-Meetup/events/h
 nbgwqyzgbrb/\n\nFor a complete listing of all events\, please visit https:/
 /kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/
