DESCRIPTION:Don Batts will be showing the work flow on how to create a 6" x
  10" x 3/4" sign on one of his CNC machine. The design will have the partic
 ipant's last name cut into a piece of hardwood. The type of cutting will be
  "V-carving". The wood will be provide in the cost of the activity. \n\n$10
  for members\n$15 for non-members\n\nThis is a introductory activity and wi
 ll show the basic steps in producing a sign. The instructor will concentrat
 e on the steps for "V-carving" to give the participants a better understand
 ing of the process. Further instruction will be required at a later time to
  produce additional designs. 
