DESCRIPTION:Join us on the Third Monday of the month to learn about electro
 nics. We are working with the Radio Shack Electronic Learning Lab and worki
 ng our way through the accompanying workbook by Forrest Mims. Each month we
  progress through the workbook to learn new aspects of electronics.\n\nThis
  month we will continue to explore amplifier IC's and comparators supplied 
 with the Electronic Learning Lab.\n\n\nNew attendees to the Introduction to
  electronic circuits series will need to pay a $5 workshop fee. Non-members
  of the KzooMakers makerspace will be charged a $5 facility fee. \n\nLimite
 d to 8 participants\n\nQuestions to: ronald.schubot@kzoomakers.org\n\n\nRSV
 P: https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/261379697/\n\nFor a complete li
 sting of all events\, please visit https://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/
