DESCRIPTION:REGISTER THROUGH EVENTBRITE by clicking this link:\nhttps://www
 .eventbrite.com/e/147285511931\n\nWhether an idea\, in process\, or finishe
 d\, do you have a project you are excited to make? Share here and learn wha
 t others are up to.\n\nIf you are a crafter\, hobbyist\, artist\, business 
 owner\, knitter\, do it yourself-er\, maker\, foodie\, and other categories
  not named\, we want to know what you are working on! We know you are makin
 g things\, with or without the help of shop tools. Here is a chance to take
  a turn to share or just sit and learn.\n\nModerated by Stacy Belinsky (Ser
 endipity Spot/Kzoo Makers) and co-hosted with Christopher Kaminsky (Lakesho
 re Fab Lab).\n\nThanks to Jo Szczepanska for sharing their work (Photo) on 
 Unsplash.\n\nAgenda:\nRound table introductions during the first 5 minutes\
 n5-7 presenters\, 5 minutes each\nAnnouncements\, 5 -10 minutes at the end\
 nNext date - November 5\, 2020
