 e assembly/the resin pour and the second (Sunday) will be flattening and fi
 nishing.  </span></span></p><p><span><span>Cutting board laser etching is d
 one at another event\, with many designs/personalizations. </span></span><b
 r><span><span><span>Additional items are available to purchase after event.
