DESCRIPTION:\nHi guys! We will now be running workshops on Sunday as well a
 s Saturday. Please choose the time that works best for you.\n***Please Note
 : Saturday workshops will be open to Kalamazoo Makerspace members from now 
 on. Sunday workshops will be woman only.\nCome make a friendly own pencil h
 older with a customizable flower!\n\n*Significantly easier project than the
  infinity cube.\n\nCost to attend: $25/35\nKzoo Maker Paying Member/Non-mem
 ber\n\nIn this workshop\, attendees will:\n\n-purchase a kit of pre-cut par
 ts\n-tweak their parts on the belt sander\n-free hand tack parts together\n
 -be allowed extra pre-cut pieces if need be\n-use dremel and wire wheel to 
 clean up tacks\n-Take home what they make!\n\nDuring this workshop we will 
 be exposed to heat\, sparks\, and sharp metal edges. Gloves\, jackets\, and
  welding helmets will be provided. Attendees MUST wear natural fiber pants 
 and closed toe shoes\, NO MESH TENNIS SHOES ALLOWED.\n\nIt is recommended t
 hat you wear or bring a long sleeved shirt.\n\nLimit of 5\n\nContact: allis
 on.poliak@kzoomakers.org\n\nRSVP: https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/
 261813573/\n\nFor a complete listing of all events\, please visit https://k
 zoomakers.org/events-calendar/
