LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Owl Pencil Holder Sunday Session (women's welding only)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
