DESCRIPTION:<br><br>Are you looking for collaboration or tips? Do you want 
 to see what others are up to? The Kzoo Makers invite you to come down and b
 ring your project (or link to photos) to showcase and tell us what you are 
 working on. You do not have to be a Kzoo Maker paying member - this event i
 s free and open to the public. These showcases will be twice a month\, on t
 he second and fourth Saturdays\, from 4:00pm to 4:30pm. Tours of the facili
 ty will also be available during this time. You are invited to join Kzoo Ma
 kers and have access to our tools and equipment to create your dreams. Look
 ing forward to seeing you soon!<br><br>RSVP: <a href="https://www.eventbrit
 e.com/e/showcase-your-project-tickets-55739504358" target="_blank" id="ow14
 19" __is_owner="true">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/showcase-your-project-ti
 ckets-59998027716</a><br><br>For a complete listing of all events\, please 
 visit <a href="http://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/" target="_blank">kzoo
 makers.org/events-calendar/</a>
