DESCRIPTION:This workshop will introduce you to TIG welding. You will learn
  safety first\, including personal protection equipment and basic welding o
 perations\, cleaning\, set up\, and take down.\n\nWe have 5 jackets and 5 h
 elmets\, and several sets of gloves. If you have any PPE already\, please b
 ring it. If you are bringing a guest\, and we are over 6 people\, they may 
 only be able to observe. If so they will not be asked to pay.\n\nATTENTION:
  you are required to wear closed toed (preferably leather) shoes. NO MESH T
 ENNIS SHOES\, no flip flops\, no sandles. Please also wear natural fiber cl
 othes\, long sleeves and pants. Denim jeans work great. Linen\, cotton\, an
 d leather are also acceptable.\n\nWith successful completion of this worksh
 op\, you will be able to sign up for other MIG project workshops.\n\nContac
 t: allison.poliak@kzoomakers.org\n\nLimit: 6\n\nCost: \n$40/member\n$50/non
  member\n\nRSVP: https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/tbwrbryzjbxb/\n\n
 For a complete listing of all events\, please visit https://kzoomakers.org/
 events-calendar/
