LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Intro to TIG Welding: Exposure and Tack (required safety training)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
