DESCRIPTION:REGISTER THROUGH EVENTBRITE by clicking this link: <a href="htt
 ps://www.eventbrite.com/e/project-show-n-tell-virtual-edition-tickets-12447
 5305991">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/project-show-n-tell-virtual-edition-t
 ickets-124475305991</a><br><br>Whether an idea\, in process\, or finished\,
  do you have a project you are excited to make? Share here and learn what o
 thers are up to.<br><br>If you are a crafter\, hobbyist\, artist\, business
  owner\, knitter\, do it yourself-er\, maker\, foodie\, and other categorie
 s not named\, we want to know what you are working on! We know you are maki
 ng things\, with or without the help of shop tools. Here is a chance to tak
 e a turn to share or just sit and learn.<br><br>Moderated by Stacy Belinsky
  (Serendipity Spot/Kzoo Makers) and co-hosted with Christopher Kaminsky (La
 keshore Fab Lab).<br><br>Agenda:<br>Round table introductions during the fi
 rst 5 minutes<br>5-7 presenters\, 5 minutes each<br>Announcements\, 5 -10 m
 inutes at the end<br>Next date - November 5\, 2020
