DESCRIPTION:We all get junk mail\, here's another way to recycle it! With s
 ome DIY monoprinting techniques\, we'll play with acrylic paint to create a
 n 8”x10” farm landscape on a canvas panel. Artist <a href="http://www.annab
 arnhart.com" id="ow445" __is_owner="true">Anna Barnhart</a> will demonstrat
 e how to combine texture and contrast while giving tips for creating atmosp
 heric perspective. You can use this technique to make all sorts of things\,
  and you don’t have to be proficient with brushwork!&nbsp\;<br><br><br>Ages
  16 and older\, max 10 students.&nbsp\;<br><br>Kzoo Makers members $20\, No
 n-members $25.&nbsp\;<br><br><b>Please contact the workshop leader to regis
 ter and claim your spot. greengiraffeart@gmail.com</b><br><b><br></b><br>Fo
 r a complete list of events\, please visit https://kzoomakers.org/events-ca
 lendar/
