LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Infinity cube demo -Woman's welding 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
