DESCRIPTION:REGISTER THROUGH EVENTBRITE by clicking this link: https://www.
 eventbrite.com/e/128771241249\n\nWhether an idea\, in process\, or finished
 \, do you have a project you are excited to make? Share here and learn what
  others are up to.\n\nIf you are a crafter\, hobbyist\, artist\, business o
 wner\, knitter\, do it yourself-er\, maker\, foodie\, and other categories 
 not named\, we want to know what you are working on! We know you are making
  things\, with or without the help of shop tools. Here is a chance to take 
 a turn to share or just sit and learn.\n\nModerated by Stacy Belinsky (Sere
 ndipity Spot/Kzoo Makers) and co-hosted with Christopher Kaminsky (Lakeshor
 e Fab Lab).\n\nThanks to Jo Szczepanska for sharing their work (Photo) on U
 nsplash.\n\nAgenda:\nRound table introductions during the first 5 minutes\n
 5-7 presenters\, 5 minutes each\nAnnouncements\, 5 -10 minutes at the end\n
 Next date - November 5\, 2020
