DESCRIPTION:<span></span>We've been wearing face masks for a while. How abo
 ut we switch it up?<p><span><span>Come check out our industrial laser cutte
 r. You’ll get an overview of how Pepakura works to make 3D models into pape
 rcraft files\, then we'll make a spooky low-polygon mask out of fancy cards
 tock. Designs made possible by Wintercroft. (<a href="http://www.wintercrof
 t.com">www.wintercroft.com</a>)</span></span></p><p><span><span>Each guest 
 will leave with one mask in a color of their choice. Additional laser cut i
 tems are available to purchase at event.</span></span></p><p><span><span><b
 >Event is $40 for single admission but cheaper if you bring a friend ($70 f
 or two)</b></span><span>. </span></span></p><p><span><span><b>Kzoo Makers M
 embers: $35 (Two tickets for $60)</b></span></span></p><p><span><span><b>Ev
 ent limited to 10 participants due to COVID guidelines.</b></span></span></
 p><br><span><b>BUY TICKETS HERE: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/121896512751<
 /b></span><span><br></span>
