DESCRIPTION:Are you a current (paying) member of Kzoo Makers who would like
  to help with a Raspberry Pi Kiosk project for the maker space? No previous
  experience required. \n\n\nWe will start in the meeting area and watch a 1
 0 minute overview video\, then move into the computer lab. There is a combi
 nation of videos and a handout to guide the group through the steps. Based 
 on what step the group is on\, a decision will be made by 4:30pm if/when th
 ere will be a day 2.\n\nThe result will be an electronic display via a TV m
 onitor in place of the corkboard in the meeting area (to the right of the d
 isplay cases/whiteboard).\n\nSteps include:\nUnboxing items \nInstalling th
 e operating system to the SD card\nEnabling and using Secure Shell setup (a
 llows the use of the Pi remotely)\nConnecting to the website slideshow page
 s\n\nContact stacyb@kzoomakers.org with any questions.\n\nFree and for (pay
 ing) members only. If this is scheduled earlier than your normal membership
  access\, please ring the doorbell.\n\nRSVP: https://www.meetup.com/KzooMak
 ers/events/264654241/\n\nFor a complete listing of all events\, please visi
 t https://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/
LAST-MODIFIED:20190908T004114Z
LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Raspberry Pi Web Kiosk Build\, Day 1
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
