 ke gifts for friends. </span></span></p><p><span><span>Any night out is mad
 e better with lasers. Come check out our industrial laser cutter. You’ll ge
 t a brief overview of how lasers work then we'll etch a fancy personalized 
 cutting board out of solid walnut and finish them with oil. </span></span><
 /p><p><span><span>We'll have a few variants to choose from\, both wholesome
  and funny\, more images to come. :)</span></span></p><p><span><span>Each g
 uest receives one cutting board. Additional wood items are available to pur
 chase after event.</span></span></p><h3><span><span>General Public</span></
 span></h3><p><span><span><b>$69 - 1 Tickets</b></span></span></p><p><span><
 span><b>$99 - 2 Tickets\, 1 Board (&lt\;3)</b></span></span></p><p><span><s
 pan><b>$129 - 2  Tickets\, 2 Boards</b></span></span></p><h3><span><span>Kz
 oo Makers Members</span></span></h3><p><span><span><b>$59 - 1 Ticket\, 1 Bo
 ard</b></span></span></p><p><span><span><b>$89 - 2 Tickets\, 1 Board (&lt\;
 3)</b></span></span></p><p><span><span><b>$119 - 2  Tickets\, 2 Boards</b><
 /span></span></p><b><span></span></b><br><span><b>TICKETS HERE: https://www
 .eventbrite.com/e/134282393253</b><br></span>
