DESCRIPTION:This workshop covers basic operation of the maker-space's drill
  press and band saw\, for metal only. We will cover speed and feed selectio
 n\, and work-holding techniques. With the successful completion of this cla
 ss you will be certified to use the drill press and horizontal band saw on 
 your own.\n\nATTENTION: there is potential for injury in this workshop. We 
 operate with SAFETY FIRST!\n\nPlease wear closed toe shoes.\n\nLimit of 6\n
 \nContact: allison.poliak@kzoomakers.org\n\nCost: \n$25/member\n$30/non mem
 ber\n\nRSVP: https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/tlvrbryzjbwb/\n\nFor 
 a complete listing of all events\, please visit https://kzoomakers.org/even
 ts-calendar/
