 s size is limited to 12: \n\n-4 people needing to use computers\n-4 bringin
 g laptops\n-4 more that can either bring personal laptops or use my extra m
 achines that I can supply if needed\, (I have three 12 inch Microsoft Surfa
 ce Pro's and a Macbook Pro available if needed.)\n\nI'll be teaching using 
 a Surface Book 2 running Win 10 pro.\n\nFor more information please contact
  Carl Stender at:\ncarl.stender@kzoomakers.org\n(269)-806-6620 (text)\n\nht
 tps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=beebJ6fgVPo\n\nhttps://kzoomakers.org/events-
