DESCRIPTION:During this free event\, attendees are invited to watch a demo 
 on how to construct a small welded sculpture using tack welding. Helmets\, 
 jackets\, and gloves will be provided for all participants. This will be ob
 servation and interaction only\, with the opportunity to hang out\, chat\, 
 and eat cookies after the demo.\n\nAttendees will be exposed to heat\, spar
 ks\, and hot metal. Proper eye protection (helmets) will be required while 
 the instructor is welding. Long sleeves and pants are required\, as standin
 g too close to a welding arc can cause arc burn on exposed skin.\n\nCost:\n
 FREE!\n\nRequirments: long sleeves and pants.\n\nNOTE: if the RSVP list is 
 full\, you may still drop in provided that you bring your own helmet or cut
 ting goggles shade 9 or higher. PLEASE DO NOT attempt to watch in sunglasse
 s. This will not be permitted\n\nLimit: 5 attendees\n\nRSVP: https://www.me
 etup.com/KzooMakers/events/261062168/\n\nQuestions: allison.poliak@kzoomake
 rs.org\n\nFor a complete listing of all events at Kzoo Makers\, please visi
 t https://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/
LAST-MODIFIED:20190501T014218Z
LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Spring Man - Kzoo Maker Members Welding Demo
TRANSP:OPAQUE
