DESCRIPTION:TOURS WILL BE AVAILABLE TO THOSE WHO PRE-REGISTER FOR AN AVAILA
 BLE TIME SLOT\n\nLIMITED QUANTITY PER SLOT\n\nTOURS WILL BE CANCELED FOR SA
 TURDAY IF NO ONE HAS REGISTERED BY WEDNESDAY\n\nUSE THIS LINK https://www.e
 ventbrite.com/e/tour-the-local-makerspace--tickets-55803534875\n-----------
 ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 --------------\nA makerspace is a community-operated work space where peopl
 e with common interests can meet\, socialize and collaborate. The Kzoo Make
 rs invite you to pre-register and come down to tour the facility. Tours are
  available from 4:30-6pm most Saturdays (see schedule). The space is roughl
 y 9000 square feet including electronics\, fiber arts\, a computer lab\, 3D
  printing\, laser cutting\, a meeting area\, a workshop/assembly area\, mac
 hine shop\, wood shop\, welding\, and much more.\n\nLearn more about makers
 paces\, see what Kzoo Makers are up to\, and let us know what interests you
 . You are invited to join and have access to our tools and equipment to cre
 ate your dreams. Looking forward to meeting you soon!\n--------------------
 --------------------------------------------------------------------------\
 n\nFor a complete listing of all events\, please visit kzoomakers.org/event
 s-calendar/
