 136043360353">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/project-show-n-tell-virtual-edit
 ion-tickets-136043360353</a><br><br>Whether an idea\, in process\, or finis
 hed\, do you have a project you are excited to make? Share here and learn w
 hat others are up to.<br><br>If you are a crafter\, hobbyist\, artist\, bus
 iness owner\, knitter\, do it yourself-er\, maker\, foodie\, and other cate
 gories not named\, we want to know what you are working on! We know you are
  making things\, with or without the help of shop tools. Here is a chance t
 o take a turn to share or just sit and learn.<br><br>Moderated by Stacy Bel
 insky (Serendipity Spot/Kzoo Makers) and co-hosted with Christopher Kaminsk
 y (Lakeshore Fab Lab).<br><br>Thanks to Jo Szczepanska for sharing their wo
 rk (Photo) on Unsplash.<br><br>Agenda:<br>Round table introductions during 
 the first 5 minutes<br>5-7 presenters\, 5 minutes each<br>Announcements\, 5
  -10 minutes at the end<br>Next date - November 5\, 2020
