DESCRIPTION:\nLearn how to make this adorable embroidery project.  You will
  learn four embroidery stitches:  spider-web rose\, fishbone stitch\, stem 
 stitch and French knot.  Once you learn the techniques\, we will stitch the
 m to fit inside a 1.5 inch hoop.  Multiple colors of thread will be availab
 le. \n \n$10 for members\, $15 for non-members
