DESCRIPTION:Mark and Dan will be given a tour of their sawmill and solar ki
 ln on Thursday\, July 26th at 6:30 pm. This tour will involve them talking 
 about the operation of the kiln and a demonstration of the mill sawing lumb
 er. The address of the tour will be at 69644 26th Street\, Lawton\, MI.\n\n
 Don Batts will be meeting before at the makerspace at 6:00 pm if groups wou
 ld like to carpool out to the site. Don has the direction to the site and m
 ight be able to provide a ride if you contact him (donbatts@gmail.com)
