DESCRIPTION:<br><p>Enjoy the smell of sawdust in the evening. Come check ou
 t our woodshop. You’ll get a brief tour and then we'll use our table saw\, 
 chop saw and sanding stations to make some simple but beautiful hardwood co
 asters. We'll also go over various finishing methods.</p><p><b>NOTE: This p
 airs well with an event in our Laser Cutting area where we will etch design
 s onto these coasters. Check out our calendar to sign up!<br></b></p><p>Eac
 h guest will receive a pair of coasters with cork backing. Additional items
  are available to purchase during event.</p><p><b>Event is $50 for single a
 dmission </b><b>(Two for $90)</b>. Bring a friend!<br></p><p><b>Kzoo Makers
  Members: $40 (Two for $70)</b></p><br><span><b>TICKETS HERE</b>: https://w
 ww.eventbrite.com/e/118252938723<br></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T101304Z
LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA\, L
 aser\, Meeting Area
