DESCRIPTION:Cards\, anyone?  The Makers’ Chill & Play Card Social is hosted
  weekly on Thursdays at 5:30pm for a couple of hours. Snacks and water/soda
  are available to purchase. You are welcome to bring food/snacks to eat/sha
 re.\nGames are chosen based on the number of participants and the interest 
 of the group. Sometimes\, there are enough participants to split into two g
 roups (usually Euchre and something else). \nAll are welcome to join! You d
 o not need to be a member of Kzoo Makers. Tours available for anyone new to
  Kzoo Makers.\nIf you have a card game to bring\, that is ok\, too. Regular
  decks of cards are available\, and so is a mechanical (3D printed) card sh
 uffler.\nIf you can imagine cards as something relaxing and chill\, that’s 
 what this card game group is all about.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260216T051833Z
LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA\, M
 eeting Area
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY: Makers’ Chill & Play Card Social
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
