DESCRIPTION:<span>Interested in lasers? Come check out ours. Meet with arti
 st Kevin Hayden as he takes you through the basic workflow of an 80W laser 
 cutter and we make both an acrylic faceshield and door opener! There will b
 e a short lecture and a demonstration.<br><br><b>Tickets will be $40 (Two t
 ickets for $70\, so bring a friend! Difference refunded at event.)</b> and 
 each attendee will receive both PPE items.<br><br><b>Kzoo Makers Members: $
 30 (Two tickets for $50)</b><br></span><br><span>Limit of 10 attendees due 
 to social distancing guidelines. Please wear a mask during this event\, for
  everyone's safety.</span><span><br></span><br><span>TICKETS HERE: <a href=
 "https://www.eventbrite.com/e/make-and-take-ppe-on-the-laser-cutter-tickets
 -108071298162">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/make-and-take-ppe-on-the-laser-
 cutter-tickets-108071298162</a></span><span></span><br><span>You can also p
 ay at event (recommended for members).<br></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T101429Z
LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA\, L
 aser\, Meeting Area
