DESCRIPTION:Cards anyone?\nAll are welcome to join! We&#39\;ve played Euchr
 e\, Hearts\, Seven\, Flinch\, and Golf. If you have a card game to bring\, 
 that is ok\, too. We select based on the group interest and the number of p
 articipants.\nSnacks to share are welcome. There is also a small selection 
 available for purchase through the organization.\nIf you can imagine cards 
 as something relaxing and chill\, that’s what this card game group is all a
 bout.\n\nQuestions/comments/confirmations\, please email <a href="mailto:st
 acyb@kzoomakers.org" target="_blank">stacyb@kzoomakers.org</a> (mailto:<a h
 ref="mailto:stacyb@kzoomakers.org" target="_blank">stacyb@kzoomakers.org</a
 >).
