DESCRIPTION:REGISTER THROUGH EVENTBRITE by clicking this link: https://www.
 meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/276258834/\n\nWhether an idea\, in process\, o
 r finished\, do you have a project you are excited to make? Share here and 
 learn what others are up to.\n\nIf you are a crafter\, hobbyist\, artist\, 
 business owner\, knitter\, do it yourself-er\, maker\, foodie\, and other c
 ategories not named\, we want to know what you are working on! We know you 
 are making things\, with or without the help of shop tools. Here is a chanc
 e to take a turn to share or just sit and learn.\n\nModerated by Stacy Beli
 nsky (Serendipity Spot/Kzoo Makers) and co-hosted with Christopher Kaminsky
  (Lakeshore Fab Lab).\n\nThanks to Jo Szczepanska for sharing their work (P
 hoto) on Unsplash.\n\nAgenda:\nRound table introductions during the first 5
  minutes\n5-7 presenters\, 5 minutes each\nAnnouncements\, 5 -10 minutes at
  the end\nNext date - November 5\, 2020
