 . Part 2 will be given on March 1st at 6:00 pm. The price includes both wor
 kshops.&nbsp\;<br><br>A few of the steps included in this workshop:<br>Part
  2<br>• operating a table saw&nbsp\;<br>• operating a large drum sander<br>
 • operating a plunge router<br>• operating a palm router<br>• applying a fi
 nish of food safe mineral oil<br><br><br>This is a hands on workshop. You w
 ill using several different tools from sanders\, routers.<br><br>Note: A pi
 cture of the finished product will be added to this post before the event o
 ccurs.&nbsp\;<br><br>Cost:<br>$30 for members (materials included)<br>$40 f
 or non-members (materials included)<br><br>Additional pieces are available 
 for an additional cost.<br><br>Safety training will be provided.&nbsp\;<br>
