DESCRIPTION:Join us on the Third Monday of the month to learn about electro
 nics. We are working with the Radio Shack Electronic Learning Lab and worki
 ng our way through the accompanying workbook by Forrest Mims. Each month we
  progress through the workbook to learn new aspects of electronics.\n\nThis
  month experienced participants can continue to work on electronic learning
  lab exercises and for new participants we will review basic electronics pr
 incipals like electronics components and Ohm's law. \n\nThere is a $5 works
 hop fee and Non-members of the KzooMakers makerspace will be charged a $5 f
 acility fee.\n\nFee Members/Non-members: $5/$10\n\nLimited to 8 participant
 s\n\nQuestions to: ronald.schubot@kzoomakers.org\n\n\nRSVP: https://www.mee
 tup.com/KzooMakers/events/dnhzbryzjbwb/\n\nFor a complete listing of all ev
 ents\, please visit https://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T101426Z
LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA\, M
 eeting Area
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Introduction to Electronic Circuits
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
