 p:<br>Smoothing the corners<br>Sealing the surfaces<br>Adding cork backing<
 br>Burning an simple design into the surface.<br><br>This is a hands on wor
 kshop. You will using several different tools from sanders\, routers\, and 
 a laser engraver.<br><br>Note: A picture of the finished product will be ad
 ded to this post before the event occurs.&nbsp\;<br><br>Cost:<br>$20 for me
 mbers (4 hardwood blanks include)<br>$30 for non-members (4 hardwood blanks
  include)<br><br>Additional pieces are available for an additional cost.<br
 ><br>Safety training will be provided.&nbsp\;<br>Safety equipment will be p
 rovided.<br><br>**This workshop will be a repeating event.<br><br>Limit of 
 4 attendees.&nbsp\;<br>RSVP:&nbsp\;<a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=ht
