DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><p><span><span>Are you eating snacks on plates? .
 ...Like a *peasant*? Come check out our woodshop. You’ll get a brief overvi
 ew of how some of our tools work then we'll put together a fancy serving tr
 ay out of hardwood\, with a resin "river" center. </span></span></p><p><spa
 n><span>We'll have a few colors to choose from -- in-studio images of finis
 hed boards to come. :)</span></span></p><p><span><span>This class will take
  place in two sessions to allow time for the resin to cure. The first day w
 ill be assembly/the resin pour and the second (Sunday) will be flattening a
 nd finishing.  </span></span></p><p><span><span>Cutting board laser etching
  is done at another event\, with many designs/personalizations. </span></sp
 an><br><span><span><span>Additional items are available to purchase after e
 vent. </span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p><span><span><b> </
 b></span></span><p><span><span><b><span></span></b></span></span></p><p><sp
 an><span><b>General Public <br></b></span></span></p><p><span><span><b>$85 
 - 1 Ticket</b></span></span></p><p><span><span><b>$110 - 2 People\, 1 Board
 </b></span></span></p><p><span><span><b>$155 - 2  Tickets\, 2 Boards</b></s
 pan></span></p><h3><span><span>Kzoo Makers Members</span></span></h3><p><sp
 an><span><b>$75 - 1 Ticket </b></span></span></p><p><span><span><b>$100 - 2
  People\, 1 Board</b></span></span></p><p><span><span><b>$145 - 2  Tickets\
 , 2 Boards </b></span></span></p><br><span><b>TICKETS HERE: <a href="https:
 //www.eventbrite.com/e/494529851097" id="ow1701" __is_owner="true">https://
