DESCRIPTION:Kzoo Makers!  We have been invited to participate in the Barnes
  & Noble Mini Maker Faire (MMF) again this year.  KM has participated for t
 he last 2 years\, and it has been very successful.\n\n\nThe Date: Saturday\
 , October 13\nTimes: Set-up  Friday\, October 12 between 5-10 PM\nMMF     S
 aturday\, October 13.  Typically runs from 11:00 until 6:00.\n\nWe will bas
 ically take over the center of the store for this event.  Bring active proj
 ects\, show pieces\, and your Maker spirit!\nThere will be tables\, chairs 
 and electric power.  \n\nNew this year\, we will be participating in the B&
 N Book Faire\, which means we will get a percentage of the day’s sales dona
 ted to the space!\n\nContact Al for any questions at al@kzoomakers.org
