DESCRIPTION:This month we will explore the use of IR detector modules. In t
 heir simplest form they can turn on an LED or activate a relay when they de
 tect a signal from an IR remote. But\, add an arduino to the mix and they a
 re the basis for remote controlling your project. We will also have time to
  discuss other electronics questions you may have. Participants will receiv
 e an IR detector module. Bring an IR remote to experiment with. \n\nLimited
  to 8 participants.\n\n\nWorkshop is $5 for KMS members\, $10 for non-membe
 rs.\n\nContact: ronald.schubot@kzoomakers.org\n\nRSVP: https://www.meetup.c
 om/KzooMakers/events/263245552/\n\nFor a complete listing of all events\, p
 lease visit https://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/
