UID:5mpqbko59jh82b4ckp8apbevkf@google.com
CREATED:20171023T181256Z
DESCRIPTION:Carl Stender is going to speak at the monthly Kalamazoo Invento
 rs Network .The presentation (talk/discussion/Q&A) will be at the Kzoo Make
 rs' building located at 1102 E. Michigan\, just east of downtown Kalamazoo.
 \n\nThe presentation will be geared towards people and businesses that want
  to take their idea from concept through prototyping and production manufac
 ture. The emphasis will be on how to find and initially approach a manufact
 urer:\n\nAgenda:\n- Basic etiquette when speaking with owners of companies 
 and/or employees in charge of getting you your quote. (how you personally c
 ome across can greatly affect the quote you receive back)\n\n- Understandin
 g the difference between legitimate inquiries and stupid questions.\n(yes t
 here are stupid questions\, VERY STUPID QUESTIONS\, you’re not in high scho
 ol anymore and dumb questions can cost you large sums of money and potentia
 l vendors in some cases)\n\n- If and when you should use a proxy for these 
 meetings\n\n- How to prepare and what to bring\n\n- Tips for lowering your 
 quoted costs\, for example how something as simple as an extra decimal plac
 e on a blueprint can cost you thousands and sometimes tens of thousands of 
 dollars.\n\n- Final selection of your vendor(s)\n\n- Negotiating pricing an
 d payments\n\n*This is only a partial list. There will be attention given t
 o the differences between finding vendors for prototyping and production al
 ong with tips for how to get your prototypes made economically. \n\nCarl St
 ender is a fourth generation machinist who splits his time between homescho
 oling 5 kids with his wife Amy and helping entrepreneurs get products ready
  for production manufacturing. Based out of his Grandpa Stender’s original 
 machine shop in Portage\, MI\, he has spent the last 23 years manufacturing
  everything from plastic injection molds to custom wheels for celebrity mot
 orcycle builders.\n\nFor inquiries about the presentation:\ncarl.stender@kz
 oomakers.org
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T101607Z
LOCATION:Meeting Area
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Kalamazoo Inventors Network presents Carl Stender
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
