DESCRIPTION:During this hour training workshop\, the Zone leader will cover
  the safety training and a simple project that allows new members ability t
 o utilize the laser cutter for their projects.\n\nThe cost $5.\n\nOnce comp
 leted and passing the member will be added to the list of limited access us
 ers. Limited access allow the member to use the equipment once the setting 
 and the materials are checked by a mentor. Once several projects are ran co
 rrectly on the equipment the user will then progress to full access. Full a
 ccess allows members to use the equipment without having the mentor check t
 he settings.
