DESCRIPTION:MOLD MAKING & CASTING MATERIALS FOR MAKING ANYTHING YOU WANT Al
 umilite has everything you need for mold making and casting. Use Alumilite 
 products for various projects including hobbies & crafts\, automotive resto
 rations\, lure making\, jewelry making\, special effects\, creative culinar
 y\, bar top coatings\, wood turning and much more. View applications and pr
 ojects made with Alumilite products.  Other uses of Alumilite products are 
 industrial short run production\, rapid prototyping\, plastic forming\, 3D 
 printing\, concrete making and more. Alumilite has high quality silicone mo
 ld making rubber\, urethane casting resins\, epoxy coating\, casting resins
 \, fillers\, dyes\, mold releases and materials.\n\nPossible applications\n
