DESCRIPTION:Electronics Forum is recurring monthly\, this topic is for this
  month only.<br>This month we will experiment with PolyFuse resettable fuse
 s. When too much current passes through the PolyFuse\, it increases resista
 nce to limit the current to a small amount. It will stay in that state unti
 l the load is removed and it cools down\, then it automatically resets. Wor
 kshop is $5 for KMS members\, $10 for non-members.<br><br>Contact: <a href=
 "mailto:ronald.schubot@kzoomakers.org">ronald.schubot@kzoomakers.org</a><br
 ><br>Limit: 8 participants<br><br>Cost: $5 Member/$10 non-members<br><br>RS
 VP: <a href="https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/265075057/" id="ow619
 " __is_owner="true">https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/265909894/</a>
 <br><br>For a complete listing of all events\, please visit <a href="https:
 //kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/">https://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/<
 /a>
