DESCRIPTION:Come make a friendly own pencil holder with a customizable flow
 er!\n\n*Significantly easier project than the infinity cube.\n\nCost to att
 end: $25/35\nKzoo Maker Paying Member/Non-member\n\nIn this workshop\, atte
 ndees will:\n\n-purchase a kit of pre-cut parts\n-tweak their parts on the 
 belt sander\n-free hand tack parts together\n-be allowed extra pre-cut piec
 es if need be\n-use dremel and wire wheel to clean up tacks\n-Take home wha
 t they make!\n\nDuring this workshop we will be exposed to heat\, sparks\, 
 and sharp metal edges. Gloves\, jackets\, and welding helmets will be provi
 ded. Attendees MUST wear natural fiber pants and closed toe shoes\, NO MESH
  TENNIS SHOES ALLOWED.\n\nIt is recommended that you wear or bring a long s
 leeved shirt.\n\nLimit of 5\n\nContact: allison.poliak@kzoomakers.org\n\nRS
 VP: https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/261813675/\n\nFor a complete l
 isting of all events\, please visit https://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/
