CREATED:20251201T200531Z
DESCRIPTION:It’s 2025\, and retro arcade brawlers are back in style! With D
 otemu’s Marvel Cosmic Invasion dropping today and recent hits like Double D
 ragon Revive & TMNT Revenge the streets are alive with pixels once again.\n
 \nJoin us as we kick off the night by celebrating the classics—Final Fight\
 , Streets of Rage\, and a curated lineup of obscure 90s brawlers.\n\nTo clo
 se out the night\, we’ll host a mystery StreetFighter’esque 3V3 tournament…
