  experience required. <br><br><br>We will continue where build day 1 left o
 ff\, and decide during the build if/when we will have day 3.<br><br>The res
 ult will be an electronic display via a TV monitor in place of the corkboar
 d in the meeting area (to the right of the display cases/whiteboard).<br><b
 r>Steps include:<br>Unboxing items <br>Installing the operating system to t
 he SD card<br>Enabling and using Secure Shell setup (allows the use of the 
 Pi remotely)<br>Connecting to the website slideshow pages<br><br>Contact <a
  href="mailto:stacyb@kzoomakers.org">stacyb@kzoomakers.org</a> with any que
 stions.<br><br>Free and for (paying) members only. If this is scheduled ear
 lier than your normal membership access\, please ring the doorbell.<br><br>
 RSVP:&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<a href="https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/266568
 542/">https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/266568542/</a>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
