 ece of lumber and turn it into a finished piece of lumber. This is a hands 
 on activity were you will get to dimensionalize one piece of hardwood.<br><
 br>The finished piece can be used for a sign blanks or shelving.&nbsp\;<br>
 <br><br><br>This activity will involves a 16" jointer\, a 20" planer\, and 
 a table saw. Safety training will be provided. <br><br>Cost:<br>$15 for mem
 bers (one 36" piece of wood is include)<br>$30 for non-members (one 36" pie
 ce of wood is include)<br><br>Safety training will be provided. <br>Safety 
 equipment will be provided.<br><br>Additional pieces are available for an a
 dditional cost.<br>Limit of 6 attendees. <br>RSVP: https://www.meetup.com/K
 zooMakers/events/248310918/<br><br>For a complete listing of events\, pleas
 e visit <a href="https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fkzoomakers.org
 %2Fevents-calendar%2F&amp\;h=ATNp7wIn3j8AoxmMdMI-5HXmEkr87KE6yEoEdEiEY8b4VK
 pi_YmZwwwTwmCB2ODJM3WdDb1uUWgXMXYMiLc8KsmNcniGncDf6VHHsq9YSn9O4Ji97fDYrw">h
 ttp://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/</a><br><br><br>**This activity will b
 e a repeating event.
