DESCRIPTION:What is your making interest? Would you like to meet others and
  be part of an area makers community? Makers of all descriptions welcome! <
 br><br>The Southwest Michigan Makers Network meetup will be held twice a mo
 nth on Sundays from 3pm-5pm. You will have a chance to introduce yourself a
 nd a maker related topic\, <span>then mingle and participate in a group act
 ivity</span><span>. Bring a project if you have one you'd like to share.</s
 pan><br><br>If you have an interest in making\, you are invited to come dow
 n and see who is in your network.<br><br>Connect on Discord: <a href="https
 ://discord.gg/mT86YZXm33"><u>https://discord.gg/mT86YZXm33</u></a><br><br>R
 SVP here: <a href="https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/">https://www.meetup.c
 om/KzooMakers/</a>
