DESCRIPTION:This month the agenda is open for any questions you have about 
 electronics\, components\, circuits or projects you are working on. No guar
 antee we can answer your question but we will give it a try. Even if you do
  not have any questions\, please attend to hear what other people are doing
 . If no one has questions or there is extra time\, I will show off some ele
 ctronics and micro-controller projects I am working on.\n\nContact Ron with
  questions at ronald.schubot@kzoomakers.org\n\nNo fee for members\, non-mem
 bers have a $5 facility fee. \n\nNote that I have moved the time up to star
 t at 6pm instead of 6:30.\n\nRSVP to https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/even
 ts/245476077/\n\nFor a complete listing of all events\, please visit http:/
 /kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/
