 rom a pre-colored image\, color animage\, add doodles to an image or make u
 p your own design.&nbsp\; Then we will add the circuit and battery so theLE
 D lights up.&nbsp\; This is a joint event betweenFiber Arts and Electronics
  Zones.&nbsp\; Wewill meet in the main meeting space.</p><p>Cost: $5 for me
 mbers\, non-members add an additional $5 forspace use.</p>\n\nJoin with Goo
 gle Meet: https://meet.google.com/ajg-gwpa-haf\nOr dial: (US) +1 862-801-07
