LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI\, Kalamazoo\, M
 I 49048\, USA\, Meeting Area
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Electronics Forum - Electronics Component Identification
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
