DESCRIPTION:REGISTER THROUGH EVENTBRITE by clicking this link https://www.e
 ventbrite.com/e/project-show-n-tell-virtual-edition-13-tickets-168176481383
 &nbsp\;<br><br><strong>Are you craving connection\, expression\, or maybe a
  safe place to share your latest creative project? Please consider joining 
 this event.</strong><br><br><br><h3>Agenda:</h3><ul><li>Introductions durin
 g the first 5 minutes</li><li>8-10 presenters\, 5-10 minutes each</li><li>A
 nnouncements\, 5 minutes at the end</li><li><strong>****UPDATED 2/1/2021***
 * Stay an additional hangout time after the presentations - 30 minutes or u
 ntil 9pm\, whichever is earlier</strong></li></ul><p>Next date- First Thurs
 day of the month</p><p></p><p></p><br><p>CALLING ALL CREATORS!!! If you are
  a crafter\, hobbyist\, artist\, business owner\, knitter\, do it yourself-
 er\, maker\, foodie\, and other categories not named\, we want to know what
  you are working on! We know you are making things. Here is a chance to tak
 e a turn to share or just sit and learn.</p><p>Moderated by Stacy Belinsky 
 (Serendipity Spot/Kzoo Makers) and co-hosted with Christopher Kaminsky (Lak
 eshore Fab Lab).</p><p>****UPDATED 2/1/2021**** Stay an additional hangout 
 time after the presentations and chat with the group for 30 minutes or unti
 l 9pm\, whichever is earlier.</p>
