CREATED:20170823T200432Z
DESCRIPTION:At this meeting we will discuss soldered and solderless breadbo
 ards. Solderless breadboards are a great way to layout and test a circuit b
 ut once you have it figured out and you want to actually use the circuit yo
 u created it is usually best to move it to a soldered circuit board. While 
 a custom circuit board could be the ideal solution we will be disucssing th
 e use of generic bords. We will have several samples of different layouts o
 f solderless and soldered breadboards and discuss which is best for your pr
 oject.  Various solderless and soldered breadboards will also  be available
  for purchase at this event.\n\nemail to schubot42-kzoomakers@yahoo.com for
  questions\n\nfree to members\, $1 facility fee for non members
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T101233Z
LOCATION:Meeting Area
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Electronics Forum - Soldered and Solderless breadboards
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
