CREATED:20190331T190229Z
DESCRIPTION:Hi guys! Saturday sessions are now open to Kalamazoo Makerspace
  Members. Sunday Sessions will be at the same time\, and will be woman's on
 ly. \n\nDuring this workshop\, we will cover:\n●what is MIG welding\n●safet
 y training and personal ●protection equipment\n●striking an arc\n●drawing a
  bead\n\nA few of the steps included in this workshop:\n●Icebreakers\n●putt
 ing on proper Personal Protection Equipment\n●Personalized instruction and 
 demo\n●face time on the welder\n•striking an arc\n•drawing a bead\n•tack we
 lding a metal vase\n\nThis is a hands on workshop. You will be exposed to h
 eat\, sparks\, and hot metal.\n\nCost:\n$35 (metal included)\n\nSafety trai
 ning will be provided.\nSafety equipment will be provided.\n\nPersonal Prot
 ection Equipment required:\n\n1) Closed Toed Shoes. Preferably leather boot
 s. Steel toe not required but recommended.\n2) Natural Fiber clothes (linen
 \, cotton\, khakis\, jeans\, leather) (Not provided)\n\nProvided: \n3) Flam
 e retardant welders jacket \n4) Welder's Helmet \n5) Leather MIG welding gl
 oves \n\nTools we will be working with:\nWelder (provided)\nWelders pliers 
 (eight ways) (Provided)\nLocking pliers (Provided)\nWire brush (provided)\n
 Chisel (provided)\nAngle Grinder (Provided\, safety training provided)\n\nC
 ontact: allison.poliak@kzoomakers.org\n\nRSVP: https://www.meetup.com/KzooM
 akers/events/261814059/\n\nFor a complete listing of all events at Kzoo Mak
 ers\, please visit https://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/
LAST-MODIFIED:20190527T200207Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Exposure and Tack Rerun
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
