DESCRIPTION:<html-blob>REGISTER THROUGH EVENTBRITE by clicking this link ht
 tps://www.eventbrite.com/e/project-show-n-tell-virtual-edition-18-tickets-2
 67423188957<br><br><strong>Are you craving connection\, expression\, or may
 be a safe place to share your latest creative project? Please consider join
 ing this event.</strong><br><br><br><h3>Agenda:</h3><ul><li>Introductions d
 uring the first 5 minutes</li><li>8-10 presenters\, 5-10 minutes each</li><
 li>Announcements\, 5 minutes at the end</li><li><strong>****UPDATED 2/1/202
 1**** Stay an additional hangout time after the presentations - 30 minutes 
 or until 9pm\, whichever is earlier</strong></li></ul><p>Next date- First T
 hursday of the month</p><p></p><p></p><br><p>CALLING ALL CREATORS!!! If you
  are a crafter\, hobbyist\, artist\, business owner\, knitter\, do it yours
 elf-er\, maker\, foodie\, and other categories not named\, we want to know 
 what you are working on! We know you are making things. Here is a chance to
  take a turn to share or just sit and learn.</p><p>Moderated by Stacy Belin
 sky (Serendipity Spot/Kzoo Makers) and co-hosted with Christopher Kaminsky 
 (Lakeshore Fab Lab).</p><p>****UPDATED 2/1/2021**** Stay an additional hang
 out time after the presentations and chat with the group for 30 minutes or 
 until 9pm\, whichever is earlier.</p></html-blob>
