DESCRIPTION:<br><br><p>Interested in lasers? Come check out ours. Meet with
  artist Kevin Hayden and learn about the various types of laser cutting mac
 hines as well as some of the science behind them.</p><p>The finale of the e
 vent will be a section where we will test cutting various unconventional th
 ings in the laser cutter. Cucumbers? Ribeye? Fireworks? <strong><b><strong>
 <b>Your grandmother?</b></strong></b></strong> No one can say. <em><em>The 
 only way to know is to come. The only way to come is to give us money.</em>
 </em></p><p>Tickets will be $49 (Two tickets for $75 - so bring a friend/da
 te/its complicated). Pizza will be served and each attendee will receive a 
 set of our hardwood fridge magnets to take home.<br></p><br><br><br><a href
 ="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/will-it-cut-a-not-so-practical-introduction-
 to-laser-cutters-tickets-1129160372069?aff=ebemoffollowpublishemail&amp\;re
 f=eemail&amp\;utm_campaign=following_published_event&amp\;utm_content=follo
 w_notification&amp\;utm_medium=email&amp\;utm_source=eventbrite">https://ww
 w.eventbrite.com/e/will-it-cut-a-not-so-practical-introduction-to-laser-cut
 ters-tickets-1129160372069?aff=ebemoffollowpublishemail&amp\;ref=eemail&amp
 \;utm_campaign=following_published_event&amp\;utm_content=follow_notificati
 on&amp\;utm_medium=email&amp\;utm_source=eventbrite</a>
