DESCRIPTION:A makerspace is a community-operated work space where people wi
 th common interests can meet\, socialize and collaborate. The Kzoo Makers i
 nvite you to come down to tour the facility. Tours are available from 4:30-
 6pm every Saturday. The space is roughly 9000 square feet including electro
 nics\, fiber arts\, a computer lab\, 3D printing\, laser cutting\, a meetin
 g area\, a workshop/assembly area\, machine shop\, wood shop\, welding\, an
 d much more.\n\nLearn more about makerspaces\, see what Kzoo Makers are up 
 to\, and let us know what interests you. You are invited to join and have a
 ccess to our tools and equipment to create your dreams. Looking forward to 
 meeting you soon!\n\nTours are free and open to the public. \n\nRSVP: https
 ://www.eventbrite.com/e/tour-the-local-makerspace-tickets-55803534875\n\nFo
 r a complete listing of all events\, please visit kzoomakers.org/events-cal
 endar/
