DESCRIPTION:This is the third and last part of this series.  We will be add
 ing LED’s to our fabric creations.  You will learn how make a simple and pa
 rallel circuit using a switch.  No prior electronics or sewing experience n
 eeded.  Cost is $5.\n\nYou may add these circuits to an existing project or
  a new project.  For new projects\, you will cut out a simple shape such as
  your initial and hot glue to the background fabric.  Next\, we will sew th
 e circuit.  Embellishments can be added\, if time permits.
