CREATED:20190527T195059Z
DESCRIPTION:Hi guys! We will now be running workshops on Sunday as well as 
 Saturday. Please choose the time that works best for you. \n***Please Note:
  Saturday workshops will be open to Kalamazoo Makerspace members from now o
 n. Sunday workshops will be women only.\n\nDescription:\n\nCome make your o
 wn infinity cube\, and do it better than me. This is a fabrication challeng
 e!\n\nCost to attend: $35\n\nIn this workshop\, attendees will:\n\n-purchas
 e a kit of pre-cut parts\n-tweak their parts on the belt sander for optimal
  fit-up\n-use a sculpy clay mold to tack their cube together\n-get extremel
 y frustrated when their parts don't fit up\n-be allowed extra pre-cut piece
 s if need be\, since the fit-up on this project is a challenge.\n-use a wir
 e wheel and hand dremel to grind their tacks and make their infinity cube s
 hine\n-Take home what they make!\n\nDuring this workshop we will be exposed
  to heat\, sparks\, and sharp metal edges. Gloves\, jackets\, and welding h
 elmets will be provided. Attendees MUST wear natural fiber pants and closed
  toe shoes\, NO MESH TENNIS SHOES ALLOWED.\n\nIt is recommended that you we
 ar or bring a long sleeved shirt.\n\nContact: allison.poliak@kzoomakers.org
 \n\nRSVP: https://www.meetup.com/Portage-Womens-Social-Meetup/\n\nFor a com
 plete listing of all events\, please visit https://kzoomakers.org/events-ca
 lendar/
LAST-MODIFIED:20190527T195059Z
LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Infinity Cube Project Sunday Session
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
