CREATED:20190505T173438Z
DESCRIPTION:Atendees will be given scrap metal and guided instructions on m
 aking their own garden art! These can be stuck in the front lawn or welded 
 into the vase you made when you took Exposure and Tack. There will be a qui
 ck exposure and tack session before the project at 4pm for anyone who has n
 ot gone through saftey training.\n\nPlease wear long sleeves and pants\, no
  polyester. Denim\, leather\, cotten\, linen\, or will are acceptable. Plea
 se wear closed toed shoes\, no mesh.\n\nCost: $35\n\nDuring this work shop 
 atendees will be exposed to heat\, sharp edges\, metal dust\, and sparks. J
 ackets\, gloves\, and helmets will be provided. Atendees are welcome to bri
 ng their own personal protection equipment as long as it is in working cond
 ition and without holes or defects.
