CREATED:20171209T155857Z
DESCRIPTION:This workshop is a continuation of the series using the Radio S
 hack Electronic Learning Lab. In this session we will learn about using rel
 ays and then learn more about resistors including the resistor color code a
 nd Ohms Law. Ohms law is one of the fundamental formulas used to understand
  electronic circuits. Note that the workshop time has changed from 6:30pm-8
 pm to 6pm-8pm\, starting a half hour earlier.\n\nMembers - free/non-members
  $5\n\nIf you have not attended any previous workshops in this series\, the
 re will be an additional charge for parts and handouts.\n\ncontact ronald.s
 chubot@kzoomakers.org with any questions\n\nFor a complete listing of all e
 vents\, please visit http://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/
