CREATED:20181030T003543Z
DESCRIPTION:We will post a picture of the building just prior to the semina
 r so you will know what to look for. There will be a sign at the entrance t
 o the parking lot and helium balloons at the correct door.\n\nAll topics ar
 e appropriate to VCarve Pro. Anything for VCarve Pro also applies to Aspire
 . Cost is $25 payable on arrival. Lunch is provided. Arrival is 9:30 am. Wr
 aps up at 3:30 pm.\n\nPlease bring a couple projects to show and tell. If y
 ou have pictures you may bring them on a thumb drive so we can show them on
  the video screens. \n\nIf you have used any files from Vectric's Design an
 d Make store\, please bring pictures on a thumb drive or even better\, the 
 actual projects. \n\nActivities will take place in one large room. The shop
  is too small to do demonstrations on the CNC machine.\n\nTopics include:\n
 \nMaking good signs better. \nMaking a height ruler. \nMaking a table leg u
 sing a standard CNC table. \nMaking fancy joints on the CNC. \nHow to use V
 ectric's Design and Make 3D projects and models.\nHow to increase your sale
 s at shows\nQuestions and Answers\n\nPresenters include Curtis Hammond\, Mi
 chael Hooper\, Christine Wells Knieper and others.\n\nLunch and snacks will
  be provided. Danish rolls\, tea and coffee upon arrival. Bottled water and
  soft drinks all day. Pizza and chips for lunch\, plus salad and fruit if d
 esired. Cookies for dessert. Trail mix for afternoon snack. We had original
 ly planned to cater in BBQ pulled pork and mac and cheese for lunch but dis
 covered there just isn't enough room for a buffet line and not enough table
 s for a sit down meal. We will have several tables along the wall so we can
  spread out a dozen or more large pizzas so everyone get their lunch quicke
 r. \n\nPlease feel free to bring your favorite cookies or brownies or other
  treats if you like. If you have dietary restrictions feel free to bring an
  appropriate lunch with you. \n\nTea\, coffee\, bottled water and soft drin
 ks will be provided during the day. Feel free to bring your own favorite be
 verage if you prefer\, as long as it is non-alcoholic. \n\nJust so you know
 \, we won't have enough room to sit at tables. There will be plenty of chai
 rs. Tables will be placed along the wall to display your projects and for p
 izza at lunch.\n\nQuestions and suggestions: Please contact Curtis Hammond 
 at tangsooman@hotmail.com\nor Dave Van Antwerp at dave@creativepartnersinc.
 com .
LAST-MODIFIED:20181030T013008Z
LOCATION:6987 Division Ave S\, Grand Rapids\, MI 49548\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CNC Seminar at Curtis Hammond’s Shop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
