 . The miter saw will receive new side stands and fences with a Kreg precisi
 on trak and stop system for both left and right sides. This is not a introd
 uction to woodworking project. The task will be for only those already comp
 etent in using the wood shop.\n\nProject leader: Dan Wilkins\nTeam: 1 to 3 
 needed\nMaterials: All materials and tools are already located at the maker
 space.\n\n\nMembers only\n\nObservation is allowed but the group will not a
 nswer random question or take any interruption from the observers.
