DESCRIPTION:This month we will continue to explore the Arduino following th
 e Arduino Experimenters Guide and work with various input and output device
 s to detect light and temperature and generate light and sound..\n\n\nThis 
 is a follow-up to the previous workshop and anyone that did not attend that
  workshop should contact me to discuss if it would be appropriate for you t
 o join now. \n\nThere is a $5 fee for KzooMaker makerspace members and $10 
 for non-members. \n\nArduino's and kits are still available if they are nee
 ded.\n\nLimited to 8 participants\n\nThis is probably the last session in t
 he series and the series should re-start again in a few months.\n\nQuestion
 s to: ronald.schubot@kzoomakers.org\n\nRSVP: https://www.meetup.com/KzooMak
 ers/events/261379832/\n\nFor a complete listing of all events\, please visi
 t https://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/
