DESCRIPTION:<p dir="ltr">The Woodworkers Guild of Southwest Michigan meets 
 on the second Tuesday of each month September-May at 7:00 pm in the main ar
 ea of the maker’s space. <i>All skill levels welcome!</i></p><p dir="ltr">M
 eetings typically involve a demonstration on rotating skills/topics. They a
 re also a great space to discuss projects and ideas with a large group of e
 xperienced woodworkers. </p><p dir="ltr">Our next meeting is on <b>Tuesday\
 , September 10th at 7:00pm</b> at the makers space. <i>This meeting will be
  a buy and sell meetup for old and new tools\, so bring anything you’d like
  to sell</i>. </p>
