DESCRIPTION:<p><span><span>Are you eating snacks on plates? ....Like a *pea
 sant*? Come check out our woodshop. You’ll get a brief overview of how some
  of our tools work then we'll put together a fancy serving tray out of hard
 wood\, with a resin "river" center. </span></span></p><p><span><span>We'll 
 have a few colors to choose from -- in-studio images of finished boards to 
 come. :)</span></span></p><p><span><span>This class will take place in two 
 sessions to allow time for the resin to cure. The first day (Friday) will b
 e assembly/the resin pour and the second (Sunday) will be flattening and fi
 nishing.  </span></span></p><p><span><span>Cutting board laser etching is d
 one at another event\, with many designs/personalizations. </span></span><b
 r><span><span><span>Additional items are available to purchase after event.
  </span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p><span><span><b> </b></s
