DESCRIPTION:\nElectronics Forum is recurring monthly\, this topic is for th
 is month only.\nThis month we will experiment with PolyFuse resettable fuse
 s. When too much current passes through the PolyFuse\, it increases resista
 nce to limit the current to a small amount. It will stay in that state unti
 l the load is removed and it cools down\, then it automatically resets. Wor
 kshop is $5 for KMS members\, $10 for non-members.\n\nContact: ronald.schub
 ot@kzoomakers.org\n\nLimit: 8 participants\n\nCost: $5 Member/$10 non-membe
 rs\n\nRSVP: https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/265075057/\n\nFor a co
 mplete listing of all events\, please visit https://kzoomakers.org/events-c
 alendar/
