 re of your love!!!\n\nCost: $20\nDuration: 12-3pm\n\nSafety equipment provi
 ded \n\nThis workshop will expose you to heat\, metal dust\, and sparks. Pl
 ease wear closed toe shoes\, long sleeves\, and pants. Natural fiber clothi
 ng only! No polyester. Denim\, leather\, linen\, cotten\, and wool are acce
 ptable.
