 ece of lumber and turn it into a finished piece of lumber. This is a hands 
 on activity were you will get to dimensionalize one piece of hardwood.\n\nT
 he finished piece can be used for a sign blanks or shelving. \n\nThis activ
 ity will involves the use the 16" jointer and 20" planer. Safety training w
 ill be provided. \n\nCost:\n$15 for members (one 36" piece of wood is inclu
 de)\n$30 for non-members (one 36" piece of wood is include)\n\nAdditional p
 ieces are avaible for Additional cost.\n\n**This activity will be a repeati
 ng event.
