DESCRIPTION:Cards anyone?\nAll are welcome to join! We've played Euchre\, H
 earts\, Seven\, Flinch\, and Golf. If you have a card game to bring\, that 
 is ok\, too. We select based on the group interest and the number of partic
 ipants.\nSnacks to share are welcome. There is also a small selection avail
 able for purchase through the organization.\nIf you can imagine cards as so
 mething relaxing and chill\, that’s what this card game group is all about.
 \n\nQuestions/comments/confirmations\, please email stacyb@kzoomakers.org (
 mailto:stacyb@kzoomakers.org).
