DESCRIPTION:Make your own 9"x12" acrylic painting in this "paint along" sty
 le workshop. Relaxing repetitive shapes and the calming blending of jewel t
 ones makes this creation a fun experience to those new to painting or those
  who want to practice color blending! Please contact Anna Barnhart at green
 giraffeart@gmail.com with questions about the event. \n\nAges 16 and older\
 , max 10 students. (Under 18 must be with parent/guardian)\nKzoo Makers pay
 ing members $20\, Non-members $25. Supplies included.\n\nRSVP: https://www.
 meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/259912619/\n\nFor a complete list of all event
 s\, please visit https://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/
