UID:3jjntnk656ql7lrvbbfa5ub77a@google.com
CREATED:20200709T230827Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Sew Kalamazoo and Kzoo Makers are teaming up to provide you 
 with the knowledge and expertise to make your own facemasks and more! Spend
  an hour and a half with us and learn to read a basic pattern\, cut out a b
 asic pattern\, operate a sewing machine and walk away with two MADE BY YOU 
 face masks.</p><p>Instruction provided by Sew Kalamazoo principle sewist Sa
 rah Osborn. Sarah has been involved in sewing and crafting for over 20 year
 s\, most recently focusing face masks. She started with focus on providing 
 masks for those front line responders when there was a shortage of PPE\, wi
 th over 500 masks donated to date Sarah continues to ensure that those who 
 take of us are taken care of.</p><p>In addition to Sew Kalamazoo Sarah is t
 he founder of Peachy Cheeks custom sewing\, with focus on children's clothi
 ng and diapers.</p><p>TICKETS HERE ($35): https://www.eventbrite.com/e/sew-
 cool-mask-sewing-workshop-tickets-110717511056</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T101159Z
LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA\, C
 raft Area
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sew Cool Mask Sewing Workshop!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
