LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI\, Kalamazoo\, M
 I 49048\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tour the Local Makerspace
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
