CREATED:20190608T190436Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the Third Monday of the month to learn about electro
 nics. We are working with the Radio Shack Electronic Learning Lab and worki
 ng our way through the accompanying workbook by Forrest Mims. Each month we
  progress through the workbook to learn new aspects of electronics.<br><br>
 This month experienced participants can continue to work on electronic lear
 ning lab exercises and for new participants we will review basic electronic
 s principals like electronics components and Ohm's law. <br><br>There is a 
 $5 workshop fee and Non-members of the KzooMakers makerspace will be charge
 d a $5 facility fee.<br><br>Fee Members/Non-members: $5/$10<br><br>Limited 
 to 8 participants<br><br>Questions to: <a href="mailto:ronald.schubot@kzoom
 akers.org" target="_blank">ronald.schubot@kzoomakers.org</a><br><br><br>RSV
 P: <a href="https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/dnhzbryzjbwb/" target=
 "_blank" id="ow804" __is_owner="true">https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/eve
 nts/dnhzbryzjbwb/</a><br><br>For a complete listing of all events\, please 
 visit <a href="https://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/" target="_blank">htt
 ps://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/</a>
