 span>We'll have a few colors to choose from -- in-studio images of finished
  boards to come. :)</span></span></p><p><span><span>This class will take pl
 ace in two sessions to allow time for the resin to cure. The first day (Fri
 day) will be assembly/the resin pour and the second (Sunday) will be flatte
 ning and finishing.  </span></span></p><p><span><span>Cutting board laser e
 tching is done at another event\, with many designs/personalizations. </spa
 n></span><br><span><span><span>Additional items are available to purchase a
 fter event. </span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p><span><span>
