 sdays</b><i><b>at 5:30pm</b></i>for a couple of hours. Snacks and water/sod
 a are available topurchase. You are welcome to bring food/snacks to eat/sha
 re.</p><p>Gamesare chosen based on the number of participants and the inter
 est ofthe group. Sometimes\, there are enough participants to split into tw
 o groups(usually Euchre and something else). </p><p>Allare welcome to join!
  You do not need to be a member of Kzoo Makers. Tours available for anyone 
 new to Kzoo Makers.</p><p>Ifyou have a card game to bring\, that is ok\, to
 o. Regular decks ofcards are available\, and so is a mechanical (3D printed
 ) cardshuffler.</p><p>Ifyou can imagine cards as something relaxing and chi
 ll\, that’s whatthis card game group is all about.</p><p>Questions/comments
 /confirmations\,please email <a href="mailto:stacyb@kzoomakers.org" target=
 "_blank"><u>stacyb@kzoomakers.org</u></a>.</p>
