DESCRIPTION:REGISTER THROUGH EVENTBRITE by clicking this link <a href="http
 s://www.eventbrite.com/e/project-show-n-tell-virtual-edition-tickets-122282
 715895">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/project-show-n-tell-virtual-edition-ti
 ckets-122282715895</a><br><br>Whether an idea\, in process\, or finished\, 
 do you have a project you are excited to make? Share here and learn what ot
 hers are up to.<br><br>If you are a crafter\, hobbyist\, artist\, business 
 owner\, knitter\, do it yourself-er\, maker\, foodie\, and other categories
  not named\, we want to know what you are working on! We know you are makin
 g things\, with or without the help of shop tools. Here is a chance to take
  a turn to share or just sit and learn.<br><br>Moderated by Stacy Belinsky 
 (Serendipity Spot/Kzoo Makers) and co-hosted with Christopher Kaminsky (Lak
 eshore Fab Lab).<br><br>Thanks to Jo Szczepanska for sharing their work (Ph
 oto) on Unsplash.<br><br>Agenda:<br>Round table introductions during the fi
 rst 5 minutes<br>5-7 presenters\, 5 minutes each<br>Announcements\, 5 -10 m
 inutes at the end<br>Next date - November 5\, 2020
