DESCRIPTION:REGISTER THROUGH EVENTBRITE by clicking this link: \nhttps://ww
 w.eventbrite.com/e/project-show-n-tell-virtual-edition-tickets-160100915147
 \n\nWhether an idea\, in process\, or finished\, do you have a project you 
 are excited to make? Share here and learn what others are up to.\n\nIf you 
 are a crafter\, hobbyist\, artist\, business owner\, knitter\, do it yourse
 lf-er\, maker\, foodie\, and other categories not named\, we want to know w
 hat you are working on! We know you are making things\, with or without the
  help of shop tools. Here is a chance to take a turn to share or just sit a
 nd learn.\n\nModerated by Stacy Belinsky (Serendipity Spot/Kzoo Makers) and
  co-hosted with Christopher Kaminsky (Lakeshore Fab Lab).\n\nThanks to Jo S
 zczepanska for sharing their work (Photo) on Unsplash.\n\nAgenda:\nRound ta
 ble introductions during the first 5 minutes\n5-7 presenters\, 5 minutes ea
 ch\nAnnouncements\, 5 -10 minutes at the end\nNext date - November 5\, 2020
