  machines as well as some of the science behind them. </span></span></p><p>
 <span><span>Afterwards\, there will be a fun section where we will test cut
 ting strange things in the laser cutter. Cucumbers? Ribeye? Fireworks? </sp
 an><span><b>Your grandmother?</b></span><span> No one can say. </span><span
 ><i>The only way to know is to come.</i></span> </span></p><p><span><span>T
 ickets will be $45 (Two tickets for $75 - so bring a friend) and each atten
 dee will receive a small gift\, with additional merch available for purchas
 e. </span></span></p><br><span><b>TICKETS HERE</b>: </span><a href="https:/
 /www.eventbrite.com/e/597954386667">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/5979543866
