DESCRIPTION:\n\nAre you looking for collaboration or tips? Do you want to s
 ee what others are up to? The Kzoo Makers invite you to come down and bring
  your project (or link to photos) to showcase and tell us what you are work
 ing on. You do not have to be a Kzoo Maker paying member - this event is fr
 ee and open to the public. These showcases will be twice a month\, on the s
 econd and fourth Saturdays\, from 4:00pm to 4:30pm. Tours of the facility w
 ill also be available during this time. You are invited to join Kzoo Makers
  and have access to our tools and equipment to create your dreams. Looking 
 forward to seeing you soon!\n\nRSVP: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/showcase-
 your-project-tickets-59998028719?aff=erelexpmlt\n\nFor a complete listing o
 f all events\, please visit kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/
