CREATED:20190902T212703Z
DESCRIPTION:\nWe are looking to retool the Makers Space to enhance the valu
 e that is provided for our members\, and we would enjoy your input. \n\n\n\
 nDECISIONS WILL BE MADE DURING THE MEETING. If you cannot make the meeting 
 time\, council or zone leadership members will be available as early as 2pm
  to hear your concerns. (Ring the doorbell if that is not your normal acces
 s time.) \n\n\n\nYou can also email suggestions\, questions\, and comments 
 to contact@kzoomakers.org if you are not available at any time Saturday.\n\
 n\nOn the agenda:\n\nReplacements for open positions\n\nShort term changes 
 and enhancements\n\nIdeas on how to improve the Makers Space
