DESCRIPTION:<span></span><p><span><span>[THIS EVENT HAS BEEN CANCELLED] <br
 ></span></span></p><p><span><span>Let's be honest. Halloween in the time of
  COVID is complicated. You whiffed it on the whole costume thing. We can he
 lp!</span></span></p><p><span><span>Come check out our industrial laser cut
 ter. You’ll get an overview of how Pepakura works to make 3D models into pa
 percraft files\, then we'll make a spooky low-polygon mask out of fancy car
 dstock. Designs made possible by Wintercroft. (<a href="http://www.wintercr
 oft.com">www.wintercroft.com</a>)</span></span></p><p><span><span>Each gues
 t will leave with one mask in a color of their choice. Additional laser cut
  items are available to purchase at event.</span></span></p><p><span><span>
 <b>Event is $40 for single admission but cheaper if you bring a friend ($70
  for two)</b></span><span>. </span></span></p><p><span><span><b>Kzoo Makers
  Members: $35 (Two tickets for $60)</b></span></span></p><p><span><span><b>
 Event limited to 10 participants due to COVID guidelines.</b></span></span>
 </p><br><span><b>BUY TICKETS HERE:</b> <a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/
 e/121896512751">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/121896512751</a></span><span><
 br></span>
