UID:5l0ogq6btgr5mnpv8ksge61f48@google.com
CREATED:20190612T164201Z
DESCRIPTION:This will be a short demonstration of ebonizing wood\, the proc
 ess of chemically making any wood a rich black color (as outlined in this a
 rticle https://www.popularwoodworking.com/techniques/ebonizing_wood/ ).\n\n
 We will take a few different species of wood through the process to demonst
 rate both areas things can go wrong\, as well as the final results between 
 differing woods. At the end of the demo there will be small samples of the 
 bark powder to take home (enough for two or so pieces of medium furniture).
 \n\nIf you have any pieces you would like to ebonize\, feel free to bring t
 hem to the demo to do so afterwards!\n\nFee: \nMembers/Non-Members\n$2/$7\n
 \nContact: Tanner - tannerp@umich.edu\n\nRSVP: https://www.meetup.com/KzooM
