DESCRIPTION:Are you a current (paying) member of Kzoo Makers who would like
  to help with a Raspberry Pi Kiosk project for the maker space? No previous
  experience required. \n\n\nWe will continue where build day 1 left off\, a
 nd decide during the build if/when we will have day 3.\n\nThe result will b
 e an electronic display via a TV monitor in place of the corkboard in the m
 eeting area (to the right of the display cases/whiteboard).\n\nSteps includ
 e:\nUnboxing items \nInstalling the operating system to the SD card\nEnabli
 ng and using Secure Shell setup (allows the use of the Pi remotely)\nConnec
 ting to the website slideshow pages\n\nContact stacyb@kzoomakers.org with a
 ny questions.\n\nFree and for (paying) members only. If this is scheduled e
 arlier than your normal membership access\, please ring the doorbell.\n\nRS
 VP: https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/264654241/\n\nFor a complete l
 isting of all events\, please visit https://kzoomakers.org/events-calendar/
LAST-MODIFIED:20190922T004502Z
LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Raspberry Pi Web Kiosk Build\, Day 2
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
