DESCRIPTION:During this workshop\, we will cover:\n●what is MIG welding\n●s
 afety training and personal ●protection equipment\n●striking an arc\n●drawi
 ng a bead\n\nA few of the steps included in this workshop:\n●Icebreakers\n●
 putting on proper Personal Protection Equipment\n●Personalized instruction 
 and demo\n●face time on the welder\n•striking an arc\n•drawing a bead\n•tac
 k welding a metal vase\n\nThis is a hands on workshop. You will be exposed 
 to heat\, sparks\, and hot metal.\n\nCost:\n$35 (metal included)\n\nSafety 
 training will be provided.\nSafety equipment will be provided.\n\n**This wo
 rkshop is part of a continuing workshop meant to expose members to welding 
 at a low price point and in a safe and instructional manner.\nIt is meant a
 s part of a series and not as a stand alone event. New members are required
  to take this class before they sign up for other workshops.\n\nPersonal Pr
 otection Equipment required:\n\n1) Closed Toed Shoes. Preferably leather bo
 ots. Steel toe not required but recommended.\n2) Natural Fiber clothes (lin
 en\, cotton\, khakis\, jeans\, leather) (Not provided)\n3) Flame retardant 
 welders jacket (class set provided\, members are encouraged to place an ord
 er with me or to purchase their own)\n4) Welder's Helmet (Class set provide
 d\, members are encouraged to place an order with me or provide their own)\
 n5) Leather MIG welding gloves (Class set provided\, members are encouraged
  to place an order with me or provide their own)\n\nTools we will be workin
 g with:\nWelder (provided)\nWelders pliers (eight ways) (Provided)\nLocking
  pliers (Provided)\nWire brush (provided)\nChisel (provided)\nAngle Grinder
  (Provided\, safety training provided)\n\nLimit of 5 attendees.\nRSVP: http
 s://www.meetup.com/Portage-Womens-Social-Meetup/events/259459006/\n\nFor a 
 complete listing of events\, please visit http://kzoomakers.org/events-cale
 ndar/\nAnd on meetup: https://www.meetup.com/Portage-Womens-Social-Meetup/
LAST-MODIFIED:20190509T201912Z
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:TENTATIVE
SUMMARY:Exposure And Tack Welding rerun for members only 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
