DESCRIPTION:This workshop will introduce you to MIG welding. You will learn
  safety first\, including personal protection equipment and basic welding o
 perations\, cleaning\, set up\, and take down. \n\nWe have 5 jackets and 5 
 helmets\, and several sets of gloves. If you have any PPE already\, please 
 bring it. If you are bringing a guest\, and we are over 6 people\, they may
  only be able to observe. If so they will not be asked to pay. \n\nATTENTIO
 N: you are required to wear closed toed (preferably leather) shoes. NO MESH
  TENNIS SHOES\, no flip flops\, no sandles. Please also wear natural fiber 
 clothes\, long sleeves and pants. Denim jeans work great. Linen\, cotton\, 
 and leather are also acceptable.  \n\nWith successful completion of this wo
 rkshop\, you will be able to sign up for other MIG project workshops. \n\nC
 ontact: allison.poliak@kzoomakers.org\n\nLimit: 6\n\nCost: \n$25/member\n$3
 5/non member\n\nRSVP:https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/wsvrbryzjbxb/
 \n\nFor a complete listing of all events\, please visit https://kzoomakers.
 org/events-calendar/
LAST-MODIFIED:20190603T214205Z
LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Intro to MIG Welding: Exposure and Tack (required safety training) 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
