DESCRIPTION:The Makers’ Chill &amp\; Play CardSocial is hosted weekly on Th
 ursdays at 5:30pm for a couple of hours.Being late is ok. You are welcome t
 o bring food/snacks to eat/share\,or purchase from the snack area. If you h
 ave a card game to bring\,that is ok\, too.<p>All are welcome to join! You 
 do notneed to be a member of Kzoo Makers. Tours available for anyone new.</
 p><p>If you can imagine cards as somethingrelaxing and chill\, that’s what 
 this card game group is all about</p>
