DESCRIPTION:<span></span><p><span><span>Any night out is made better with l
 asers. Come check out our industrial laser cutter. You’ll get an overview o
 f how Pepakura works to make 3D models into papercraft files\, then we'll m
 ake a fancy fox mask out of cardstock on our 80W laser cutter. </span></spa
 n></p><p><span><span>Each guest receives one mask in a color of their choic
 e. Additional laser cut items are available to purchase at event.</span></s
 pan></p><p><span><span><b>Event is $40 for single admission but cheaper if 
 you bring a friend ($65 for two)</b></span><span>. Difference will be provi
 ded at event if bought online.</span></span></p><p><span><span><b>Kzoo Make
 rs Members: $30 (Two tickets for $50)</b></span></span></p><br><span><b>BUY
  TICKETS HERE:</b> <a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/110433146514" id="
 ow1089" __is_owner="true">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/115114624942</a></sp
 an><br><span></span><br><span></span><span></span><span>You can also pay at
  event (recommended for members).<br></span>
