CREATED:20250401T234326Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Interested in lasers? Come check out ours. Meet with artist 
 Kevin Hayden and learn about the various types of laser cutting machines as
  well as some of the science behind them.</p><p>The finale of the event wil
 l be a section where we will test cutting various unconventional things in 
 the laser cutter. Cucumbers? Ribeye? Fireworks? <strong><b><strong><b>Your 
 grandmother?</b></strong></b></strong> No one can say. <em><em>The only way
  to know is to come. The only way to come is to give us money.</em></em></p
 ><p><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/will-it-cut-a-not-so-practical-in
 troduction-to-laser-cutters-tickets-1308273103069?aff=ebemoffollowpublishem
 ail&amp\;ref=eemail&amp\;utm_campaign=following_published_event&amp\;utm_co
 ntent=follow_notification&amp\;utm_medium=email&amp\;utm_source=eventbrite"
 >https://www.eventbrite.com/e/will-it-cut-a-not-so-practical-introduction-t
 o-laser-cutters-tickets-1308273103069?aff=ebemoffollowpublishemail&amp\;ref
 =eemail&amp\;utm_campaign=following_published_event&amp\;utm_content=follow
 _notification&amp\;utm_medium=email&amp\;utm_source=eventbrite</a><em><em><
 /em></em></p><p>Tickets will be $49 (Two tickets for $75 - so bring a frien
 d/date/its complicated). Pizza will be served and each attendee will receiv
 e a set of our hardwood fridge magnets to take home.</p>
