DESCRIPTION:Linux Conversions: 5:30 PM - 8:30 PM\nKLUG Meeting: 7:00 PM\nSa
 y goodbye to Windows 10 and hello to Linux Mint at our "Windows 10 Farewell
  Day"! Starting at 5:30 PM\, bring your desktop or laptop for a free Linux 
 conversion. Our experts will be on hand to help you transition smoothly. Th
 e KLUG meeting will begin at 7:00 PM\, where we'll discuss the benefits of 
 Linux Mint and answer any questions you may have. Enjoy a variety of snacks
  and refreshments while you learn and convert your systems.\n\nDon't miss o
 ut on these exciting events! We look forward to seeing you there and sharin
 g the joy of Linux with our community.
LAST-MODIFIED:20251105T000643Z
LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA\, M
 eeting Area
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:(KLUG) Kalamazoo Linux Users Group - Windows 10 Farewell Day
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
