DESCRIPTION:This month we will review what we have done so far and continue
  learning about resistors and various kinds of variable resistor. \n\nThis 
 workshop series introduces you to electronic circuits\, their components an
 d how to use them. We use the Radio Shack Electronics Learning lab and work
 book by Forrest Mimms to faciliate the class. We meet monthly on the 3rd Mo
 nday of the month from 6:30pm to 8:00pm at the Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michiga
 n Ave\, Kalamazoo MI.  There is no charge to KzooMakers members for the ins
 truction but there is a $5 facility charge for non members. For November th
 ere is a $5 charge for additional parts and printed material for everyone.\
 n\nTotal charge: members $5/non-members $10\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20171113T024344Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Introduction to Electronic Circuits
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
