DESCRIPTION:\nA makerspace is a community-operated work space where people 
 with common interests can meet\, socialize and collaborate. The Kzoo Makers
  invite you to come down to tour the facility. Tours are available from 4:3
 0-6pm every Saturday. The space is roughly 9000 square feet including elect
 ronics\, fiber arts\, a computer lab\, 3D printing\, laser cutting\, a meet
 ing area\, a workshop/assembly area\, machine shop\, wood shop\, welding\, 
 and much more.\n\nLearn more about makerspaces\, see what Kzoo Makers are u
 p to\, and let us know what interests you. You are invited to join and have
  access to our tools and equipment to create your dreams. Looking forward t
 o meeting you soon!\n\nTours are free and open to the public. \n\nRSVP: htt
 ps://www.eventbrite.com/e/tour-the-local-makerspace-tickets-55803534875\n\n
 For a complete listing of all events\, please visit kzoomakers.org/events-c
 alendar/
