UID:2fhhe9of260s3657ci6cls42fc@google.com
CREATED:20190406T150541Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the Third Monday of the month to learn about electro
 nics. We are working with the Radio Shack Electronic Learning Lab and worki
 ng our way through the accompanying workbook by Forrest Mims. Each month we
  progress through the workbook to learn new aspects of electronics.\n\nThis
  month we will explore the function of Op-Amps\, audio amplifiers\, and com
 parators supplied with the Electronic Learning Lab.\n\nNew attendees to the
  Introduction to electronic circuits series will need to pay a $5 workshop 
 fee. Non-members of the KzooMakers makerspace will be charged a $5 facility
  fee. \n\nLimited to 10 participants\n\nQuestions to: ronald.schubot@kzooma
 kers.org\n\n\nRSVP: https://www.meetup.com/KzooMakers/events/260399201/\n\n
 For a complete listing of all events\, please visit https://kzoomakers.org/
 events-calendar/
LAST-MODIFIED:20221210T101328Z
LOCATION:Kzoo Makers\, 1102 E Michigan Ave\, Kalamazoo\, MI 49048\, USA\, M
 eeting Area
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Introduction to Electronic Circuits
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
