 eets on the second Tuesday of each month September-May at 7:00 pm in the ma
 in area of the maker’s space. All skill levels welcome!Meetings typically i
 nvolve a demonstration on rotating skills/topics. They are also a great spa
 ce to discuss projects and ideas with a large group of experienced woodwork
 ers.
