DESCRIPTION:REGISTER THROUGH EVENTBRITE by clicking this link https://www.e
 ventbrite.com/e/168179095201<br><br><strong>Are you craving connection\, ex
 pression\, or maybe a safe place to share your latest creative project? Ple
 ase consider joining this event.</strong><br><br><br><h3>Agenda:</h3><ul><l
 i>Introductions during the first 5 minutes</li><li>8-10 presenters\, 5-10 m
 inutes each</li><li>Announcements\, 5 minutes at the end</li><li><strong>**
 **UPDATED 2/1/2021**** Stay an additional hangout time after the presentati
 ons - 30 minutes or until 9pm\, whichever is earlier</strong></li></ul><p>N
 ext date- First Thursday of the month</p><p></p><p></p><br><p>CALLING ALL C
 REATORS!!! If you are a crafter\, hobbyist\, artist\, business owner\, knit
 ter\, do it yourself-er\, maker\, foodie\, and other categories not named\,
  we want to know what you are working on! We know you are making things. He
 re is a chance to take a turn to share or just sit and learn.</p><p>Moderat
 ed by Stacy Belinsky (Serendipity Spot/Kzoo Makers) and co-hosted with Chri
 stopher Kaminsky (Lakeshore Fab Lab).</p><p>****UPDATED 2/1/2021**** Stay a
 n additional hangout time after the presentations and chat with the group f
 or 30 minutes or until 9pm\, whichever is earlier.</p>
